#### Example 3: Fitness Suite Pipeline Stage

```yaml
# .github/workflows/ci.yml
- name: Architecture Fitness Suite
  uses: gainwell/actions/fitness-suite@v1
  with:
    golden_path: ${{ steps.catalog.outputs.golden_path }}
    service_image: ${{ steps.build.outputs.image }}
    suite_version: ${{ vars.FITNESS_SUITE_VERSION }}
    mode: fail  # fail | warn
    evidence_store_url: ${{ vars.EVIDENCE_STORE_URL }}
```
